    "text": "## Description\r\n\r\nThe dataset comprises all reference parcels established by the Paying Agency Agrarmarkt Austria and covered landscape elements (landscape element layers) within the meaning of Article 5 of Regulation (EU) No 640/2014 and Regulation of the competent Federal Ministry laying down horizontal rules for the area of the common agricultural policy (Horizontal GAP Regulation) StF: BGBl.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Source Data Curator:** [Euro Crops](https://github.com/maja601/EuroCrops/wiki/Austria)\r\n- **Source Data Provider:** [Publications Office of the European Union.](https://data.europa.eu/data/datasets/ama_invekosreferenzensterreich2021?locale=en)\r\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\r\n- **License:** CC-BY-4.0\r\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\r\n- **Dataset Validity:** 2021\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\n## Attributes\r\n\r\n| Property                  | Data Type |\r\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\r\n| id                        | string    |\r\n| determination_datetime    | datetime  |\r\n| area                      | float     |\r\n| geometry                  | polygon   |\r\n| crop_id                   | int64     |\r\n| crop_name                 | string    |"
  },
